sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as WP Admin UI
    participant Plugin as Context Alt Text (WP)
    participant Recognition as Recognition API
    participant LLM as Caption Provider

    Admin->>Plugin: Trigger "Regenerate Alt Texts"
    Plugin->>Plugin: Fetch attachments with stale policy hash
    loop For each attachment
        Plugin->>Recognition: POST /api/v0/analyze-scene (if requires_scene_analysis)
        Recognition-->>Plugin: SceneAnalysisResult
        Plugin->>LLM: generateCaption(request)
        LLM-->>Plugin: Caption draft
        Plugin->>Plugin: Update draft + audit log
    end
    Plugin-->>Admin: Batch regenerate summary
